  "enable": "Set H5-01 address (default 1F hex), H5-02 baud (default 3 = 9600) and H5-03 parity (default none), then cycle power. b1-01 = 2 and b1-02 = 2 hand the frequency reference and run command to Modbus. Status reads, parameter access, fault reset and multi-function inputs work regardless of b1-01/b1-02.",
  "watchdog": "H5-05 = 1 (default) enables CE detection after H5-09 seconds (default 2.0 s) without messages; H5-04 sets the reaction: 0 ramp, 1 coast, 2 fast-stop, 3 alarm only (default). 002CH bit F shows a comm time-out.",
  "quirks": [
